    {
      "id": "summary/01/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "96a20dd29ff832e3d627ee66215421ef5fbb84ee98cdfc3f45717b835fc9396d",
      "translation": "　這是一個地球早已失去往昔文明與自然環境，各\n個地區分別形成自身社會與文化的時代。\n　縱觀歷史，人類雖失去了許多事物卻也不斷創造\n出新的東西。\n　\n　特權階級“伊諾森特”曾掌控北半球最大大陸的\n大部分區域，而這個由他們維繫的社會，最終覆滅\n於自己創造的新人類“平民”之手。\n　另一方面，統治其餘地區的中央政府雖因十五年\n前第七次宇宙戰爭引發的災禍一度瀕臨崩潰，但正\n逐步恢復統治；與中央政府敵對的宇宙革命軍也同\n樣在積蓄力量。就連始終堅持不干涉立場的“月之\n民”，也開始為了實現夙願而採取行動。\n　\n　世界即將迎來劇變，人們卻仍在為今日的生計拼\n盡全力。既不知未來將迎來何種命運，亦對過往的\n歷史全然不知……",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "event/seventh-space-war",
        "faction/innocent",
        "organization/central-government",
        "organization/space-revolutionary-army",
        "people/civilian",
        "people/moonrace"
      ],
      "notes": "“天真者／平民”存在作品异译，已列入术语人工审核。按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：faction/innocent。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "087f7373eb25d12b660dcf90b89715de9649a1aec523b6e84ff376ee725fb6bf",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/02/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "5a19dd9ed44bc117e0a8d260159c721ec0fdf771e2bb04ee02ade9f5621a5fd2",
      "translation": "　在某個世界的某條時間線上所發生的巨大時空震\n動，擊碎了次元的壁壘，無數迥異的世界與時代彼\n此交融，催生出了一個全新的世界。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "event/dimensional-shock"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "0b10827233062e1af0373c5abcef07b7b0b1372de361ac211ee81b169ead600e",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/02/001",
      "source_text_sha256": "1b57c095ac9153c85e507b253d36a98515a5a9dd139f701cea15cb77f6d41b35",
      "translation": "　然而，人類並沒有就此走向滅亡。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e45e20492829cd499fc7017254e01e157d64f80e8e5fd311c3214802611f4442",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/02/002",
      "source_text_sha256": "c0bec2de690b23dd3a36b5bf5c549fc3ec76a478078ae1430f8d4afd4df88b7e",
      "translation": "　在這場名為“世界崩壞”的時空破壞所造就的\n“多元世界”之內，人類正嘗試構築全新的秩序。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "event/break-the-world",
        "place/multiverse"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3c5a896936e503ba2b483ad70cf69695ec2b6a3bed9dec33cc7899362490e3e9",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/03/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "dce242d6f1256af6b8614a569e648466b1cabc711b77565756a4d1e59dfe6231",
      "translation": "　地球聯邦、地球聯合、中央政府以及塔州聯邦，\n組建起一個由各方麾下民眾與組織加盟的統一國\n家——“新地球聯邦”。其立下綱領，未來將以此\n名號統轄全人類。\n　基於這一立場，它自詡為世界警察開始頻頻插\n手各地紛爭，接連兼併諸多小國。\n　這番舉動雖激起多元世界原生國家“奇拉姆”\n的牴觸，但兩國仍互認對方為友好國度，確認彼\n此是在這個新世界共生共存的鄰邦。\n　由此，新地球聯邦與奇拉姆的勢力範圍以阿美\n利亞大陸為中心，覆蓋了地球總面積的70%，掌\n握了總人口的75%。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-federation",
        "organization/earth-alliance",
        "organization/central-government",
        "organization/tower-state-federation",
        "organization/new-earth-federation",
        "organization/chiram",
        "place/multiverse",
        "place/ameria-continent"
      ],
      "notes": "“奇拉姆／阿美利亚大陆”音译待跨剧情复核。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "2b4eb37ddb1056d62edbd2bc3c2aa6edbfb6eb8a285b2f64b66006b821c1de92",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/04/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "213df0c83e2885c95bd29dfaa52760eb04ee3ebcc5ec061195a70378260d59be",
      "translation": "　其他地區則在新地球聯邦之外，形成了各自獨\n立的社會。其中規模最大的，是與奇拉姆大致同\n時成為多元世界一員的“埃曼”。\n　埃曼以加利亞大陸東南部為中心，身處各個地\n區交匯之地，商品與資訊在此活躍流通；與此同\n時，埃曼人也派遣商隊前往世界各地，從事貿易。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-federation",
        "organization/new-earth-federation",
        "organization/chiram",
        "organization/emaan",
        "place/multiverse",
        "place/gallia-continent"
      ],
      "notes": "“埃曼／加利亚大陆”已查常见译法，仍待跨剧情人工复核。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "d075e76c66e050312c7c6c8f1d0c2e0827271c4771f025a875572a6ee39addd0",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/05/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "82f22ac9fab177c0578e660ee3f1822230ba0c72a5a8b4de04136808c2b934cb",
      "translation": "　憑藉埃曼人的活躍，以及以新地球聯邦為核心建\n立的全球“資訊集中與共享”系統——通稱“UN”，\n人類逐漸理解、接納並適應多元世界，最終建立起\n生活的基礎。\n　\n　然而，這個世界對人類而言依舊太過陌生，也太\n不穩定。\n　\n　大氣層上空存在一道名為“相剋界”的次元壁壘。\n受其阻隔，宇宙與地球之間的往來僅限於相剋界較\n為薄弱的加利亞大陸南部，以及太平洋上的特定區\n域。與此同時，小規模時空震動至今仍在不斷發生；\n被捲入其中的人，再也沒有回來。\n　\n　揮之不去的焦慮促使人們追逐轉瞬即逝的享樂。\n多元世界的一切，都如同這個世界本身一樣，處在\n動盪不安之中。\n　\n　有人不斷追逐籠罩世界的光粒子波；有人跟隨埃\n曼商隊奔走各地，夢想一夜暴富；也有人為了稱霸\n這片亂世，正在暗中磨利自己的獠牙。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "event/dimensional-shock",
        "organization/earth-federation",
        "organization/new-earth-federation",
        "organization/emaan",
        "place/multiverse",
        "place/gallia-continent",
        "technology/dimensional-boundary",
        "technology/trapar",
        "system/un-network"
      ],
      "notes": "UN 明确指游戏内信息系统，不译为联合国。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "ecf34ba6ee9e82917ef63ddb4dcc0877ef1f5d94385b8892ded97298459b3fc6",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/06/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "9bee1b5c603c6d742c4e05a5ddbf5954c84dbfd33a23c1d242cb5cd85f369eb7",
      "translation": "　多元世紀元年（MC.00）。\n　距離世界崩壞已過去約半年……\n　圍繞這個新世界，某種無形的力量正一點點開始\n運轉。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "era/multiversal-century",
        "event/break-the-world"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "9739049a0c31266b646d76612085009a6602b82939978d6301ab7618f1b0f69f",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/07/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "1e7587032daf0e4b2cc2f55f3b9cae5f4a270dafb1eaef2894641dbcf0baff25",
      "translation": "　新的世界，孕育出新的戰爭。正因為這裏是多元\n世界，這些戰爭愈發混亂，也即將呈現出更加錯綜\n複雜的局面。\n　\n　新地球聯邦將生活在宇宙中的人類視為敵人，宣\n布對PLANT與月之民採取敵對立場。PLANT與月之民\n起初都希望通過對話解決問題，但面對新聯邦軍的\n進攻，最終不得不還擊。\n　\n　然而，人類不僅要彼此為敵，還必須抵禦蓋佐克、\n傑拉拜亞、伊爾塔星人、阿爾特巴羅和墮天翅族等\n外敵。而在世界的陰影之中，更有新的敵人蠢蠢欲\n動。\n　\n　就在此時，一些人着眼於世界的未來，準備採取\n下一步行動。新地球聯邦、札多、月之民、奇拉\n姆、埃曼，以及……\n　\n　在這片混亂的世界裏，人們仍在竭力求生。無法\n活過今天，就不可能迎來明天。即使不知道世界將\n去向何方，人們依舊為了讓今日的生命延續至明\n日，各自投身戰鬥。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-federation",
        "organization/new-earth-federation",
        "organization/new-federation-forces",
        "organization/chiram",
        "organization/emaan",
        "organization/plant",
        "organization/zaft",
        "faction/gaizok",
        "faction/zeravire",
        "faction/elder",
        "faction/aldébaran",
        "people/moonrace",
        "place/multiverse",
        "species/fallen-angel"
      ],
      "notes": "四个外敌势力的音译均保留在术语待审队列。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "ca2a73b8f6dcaf2cc90b62263a8feb929a27f53ec8369725c09464857ffa5184",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/08/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "76005a5bbba1cb69891cfb51bad6a1b1257fe12fc15b70a1dc8e94b15cc40bc4",
      "translation": "　戰鬥中啓動的另一枚時空震動彈，再次摧毀了次\n元壁壘。這場被稱為“第二次崩壞”的時空破壞，不\n僅打亂了逐漸趨於穩定的秩序，甚至改變了大陸的\n形狀與天體的運行。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "event/dimensional-shock",
        "event/second-break",
        "technology/spacetime-oscillation-bomb"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "949215368a3460f40a97e96fb69b1fdd742ba80f30ea2e6b0c4fea742604f1dc",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/08/001",
      "source_text_sha256": "00fad7710cc07eb66c3386b848ec45e075bda39feb39d7d85840e860ddd7fbf1",
      "translation": "　人們只能再次意識到，自己所在的地方不過是一\n個毫無保障、如泡沫般脆弱的世界。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "7cc0db96fe15442316470cf3d459144f42de58574cc4ad40c7ac0aaaa6444e96",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/09/000",
      "source_text_sha256": "3aa3d212399ce6821f845fec97436bb5f7a317786cfb0fb16ae1bf85b03c376f",
      "translation": "　民眾積壓的不安爆發，最終演變成暴動。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "与 summary/09/001—006 连读。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "d466bace729befcfc5c7649bf7e83145f3b94bfdb083e23bb95c234c5d7b325c",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/09/001",
      "source_text_sha256": "34631aae2cffd432ce1eb461b6d92474f944ae3ebee6ee98c8c848c0e393c14b",
      "translation": "相關消息與不負責任的謠言一同傳遍UN，",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_exceptions": [
        "system/un-network"
      ],
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "与 summary/09/000—006 连读；原文此条的“UN”依中文语序移至 summary/09/002。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "8cdf3fd01b4ed695627ae721db6e1fef4d80d586b339d7c4eb956d470d39668b",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/09/002",
      "source_text_sha256": "203de57c326cd8b53cf4a515c2b63a41c41c7048ed188eb3a8ea15c4db73abf9",
      "translation": "也進一步加深了民眾心中原有的不安情緒。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "system/un-network"
      ],
      "notes": "与 summary/09/000—006 连读。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "f958754ff724a2adc01f7da54c51d0a1f5c02e14b8c9144f3273425ecf290844",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/09/003",
      "source_text_sha256": "d26aa00a63891dacbaf173e4a8c8241bacdbd6e944f72c48636a5925ae878aac",
      "translation": "政變後重新組建的新地球聯邦政府派出了軍隊，",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-federation",
        "organization/new-earth-federation"
      ],
      "notes": "与 summary/09/000—006 连读。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "5a5e49ec4a507100cc26d48859ea175426180de0a971a5eccd279af96920ddc7",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/09/004",
      "source_text_sha256": "6e00635226cd87380fb7a7893524b49bf7365abf9e1d8611a8227ff8fdf9b4c9",
      "translation": "對引發騷亂的民眾實施鎮壓。暴動雖被平息，",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "与 summary/09/000—006 连读。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "8808ff726b67edfef60f78c777b552fa22d8f27ab7c9c36f392132e257cefc0a",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/09/005",
      "source_text_sha256": "1e6b20def629c9b6a5182f00bdeaea7288028b1b10aaaed220a5cf08c757c90c",
      "translation": "但民眾心底根深蒂固的不安與恐懼，仍舊未能",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "与 summary/09/000—006 连读。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "488329797a1247c3d4b8862a51a5800887bd43fed4838046451e3a4b78adfdc8",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary/09/006",
      "source_text_sha256": "96cd31365543f53d0c98198c2c561df097f09aee9cb1a91b8ebc31ee74f0cc44",
      "translation": "就此得到徹底的消除。",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "与 summary/09/000—006 连读。",
